                  "from": 403.615,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2762280,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "In contrast, a prevention focus, which causes people to work more cautiously and produce higher quality work, might be very appropriate for a job like a surgeon, for example.",
