            "content": "<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>&lsquo;Self-regulatory focus theory&rsquo; and leadership</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>Self-regulatory focus theory</strong></p>\n<p>People&rsquo;s focus is to approach pleasure or avoid pain</p>\n<p>Promotion goals focus on <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_31\">______</span></p>\n<p>Prevention goals emphasise avoiding punishment</p>\n<p>Factors that affect people&rsquo;s focus</p>\n<p><strong>The Chronic Factor</strong></p>\n<p>●&nbsp; &nbsp;comes from one&rsquo;s <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_32\">______</span></p>\n<p>The <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_33\">______</span> Factor</p>\n<p>●&nbsp; &nbsp;we are more likely to focus on promotion goals when with a <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_34\">______</span></p>\n<p>●&nbsp; &nbsp;we are more likely to focus on prevention goals with our boss</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>How people&rsquo;s focus affects them</strong></p>\n<p>Promotion Focus: People think about an ideal version of themselves, their <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_35\">______</span> and their gains.</p>\n<p>Prevention Focus: People think about their &lsquo;ought&rsquo; self and their obligations</p>\n<p><strong>Leaders</strong></p>\n<p>Leadership behaviour and <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_36\">______</span>&nbsp;affects people&rsquo;s focus</p>\n<p><em>Transformational Leaders:</em></p>\n<p>●&nbsp; &nbsp;pay special attention to the <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_37\">______</span> of their followers</p>\n<p>●&nbsp; &nbsp;passionately communicate a clear <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_38\">______</span></p>\n<p>●&nbsp; &nbsp;inspire promotion focus in followers</p>\n<p><em>Transactional Leaders:</em></p>\n<p>●&nbsp; &nbsp;create <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_39\">______</span>&nbsp;to make expectations clear</p>\n<p>●&nbsp; &nbsp;emphasise the results of a mistake</p>\n<p>●&nbsp; &nbsp;inspire prevention focus in followers</p>\n<p><strong>Conclusion</strong></p>\n<p>Promotion Focus is good for jobs requiring <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_40\">______</span></p>\n<p>Prevention Focus is good for work such as a surgeon</p>\n<p>Leaders&rsquo; actions affect which focus people use</p>",
